# Line endings are not a platform preference here.
#
# Several files in this repository are generated and then committed - the
# registry the docs site serves, and the token JSON - and a generator writes
# LF. Without this, a checkout on Windows converts the committed copy to CRLF,
# the generator writes LF, and a comparison between them fails on one operating
# system while passing on the other. That is what turned CI red for a registry
# that was perfectly current.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` keeps working copies as LF on every platform, so what is
# committed, what is generated and what is published are the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and not to be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
